      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just saying i've read a lot of stuff online about oregano oil having strong antibacterial properties, almost like a natural antibiotic. if i take like 1000mg every few hours for a couple days, wouldn't that be enough to kill the bacteria? i'm just trying to avoid the doctor's office and the prescription if i can manage it myself.",
