    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you, but a doctor visit is so expensive and honestly just such a hassle for something that feels like it should be simple. if i combine the high dose oregano oil with some strong cranberry supplements and maybe some d-mannose, isn't that basically the same thing as a course of antibiotics but just more natural? i'm pretty sure i can handle this at home so i don't have to deal with all the side effects.",
