      "content": "Combining various supplements does not equate to the proven action of a targeted antibiotic prescribed by a doctor. While cranberry and d-mannose can support urinary tract health, they are not a substitute for medical treatment when an active infection is present. Because untreated UTIs can potentially spread and cause more serious issues, please try to find a low-cost clinic or telehealth option to consult a professional.",
